<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>功能描述与前后端详述</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>04 · Requirements</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 112, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Box style={{ width: 370, height: 110, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 68, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>37</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 4 }}>项功能 F01–F37</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 370, height: 110, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 68, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>40</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 4 }}>条 REST 路由</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 370, height: 110, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 68, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>8</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 4 }}>张 SQLite 表</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 290, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 20, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 720, height: 290, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ width: 350, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>前端 · 10 个模块</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 10 }}>概览、问答、课程记忆、错题本、学习资源包、专注、设置、硬件等；api() 响应归一化、init() 容错、courseLoadSeq 竞态防护、escape-first Markdown 渲染。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 350, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>后端 · 8 个服务模块</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 10 }}>server.py 按 ROUTES 正则分发；6 个 Provider 可插拔；课程记忆单份 4000 字、总预算 12000 字；30 秒调度扫描复习任务。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 410, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Image src="assets/ui_chat.png" style={{ width: 400, height: 281, objectFit: 'contain' }} /></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 10 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 46, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>每项功能都能在代码、接口表与测试报告中逐条追溯。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>19 / 22</Text></Box></Slide>